    shape: subset of 2x2 bounding box, 3-4 cells (L-triomino or full square)
    all four 3-cell L-rotations and the full 2x2 are valid; sizes 1-2 excluded (ambiguous decomposition)
  input_layout:
    exactly 4 non-overlapping translated copies of the sprite on the 6x6 grid
